window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Jewels of Gwahlur</i> by Robert E. Howard is a thrilling Conan the Barbarian adventure steeped in sword and sorcery. Set in the exotic kingdom of Keshan, Conan embarks on a perilous quest to claim the legendary treasure known as the Teeth of Gwahlur. Facing treacherous priests, false oracles, and ancient supernatural forces, Conan must navigate deadly intrigues and uncover the secrets of the haunted city of Alkmeenon.</p> <p>Brimming with action, dark magic, and Howard’s vivid world-building, this classic tale captures the clash between barbarism and civilization in a suspenseful saga of treasure, betrayal, and survival. Perfect for fans of heroic fantasy and timeless pulp adventure.</p>"; 
